sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MutWH as Mutating Webhook<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant ValWH as Validating Webhook<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant NbCtrl as Notebook Controller
    participant ODHCtrl as ODH Notebook Controller
    participant CullCtrl as Culling Reconciler

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,ValWH: Flow 1: Notebook CR Reconciliation
        User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply Notebook CR
        K8sAPI->>MutWH: POST /mutate-notebook-v1<br/>TLS, Kubernetes admission
        Note right of MutWH: Injects kube-rbac-proxy sidecar<br/>Propagates proxy env vars<br/>Mounts Elyra pipeline secret
        MutWH-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Notebook
        K8sAPI->>ValWH: POST /validate-notebook-v1<br/>TLS, Kubernetes admission
        ValWH-->>K8sAPI: Validated
        K8sAPI-->>User: Notebook created/updated

        K8sAPI->>NbCtrl: Watch event: Notebook
        NbCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update StatefulSet
        NbCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service

        K8sAPI->>ODHCtrl: Watch event: Notebook
        ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy
        ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>(via data-science-gateway)
        ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ReferenceGrant<br/>(cross-namespace routing)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over CullCtrl,K8sAPI: Flow 2: Idle Notebook Culling
        CullCtrl->>K8sAPI: Read Pod metadata & annotations
        Note right of CullCtrl: Check idle timeout
        CullCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update Notebook CR status<br/>(scale StatefulSet to zero)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over ODHCtrl,K8sAPI: Flow 3: Elyra Pipeline Secret Provisioning
        ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Watch DataSciencePipelinesApplication CRs
        Note right of ODHCtrl: DSPA named "dspa" found & ready
        ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Get Gateway<br/>(data-science-gateway in openshift-ingress)
        ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Secret "ds-pipeline-config"<br/>(Elyra runtime config at /opt/app-root/runtimes)
    end
